  "title": "RSS Friends Register as Foreign Agent in US to Step Up Outreach",
  "summary": "RSS Friends, which provided a Georgia address in the registration document, registered with the US Department of Justice as a foreign agent to support its outreach efforts in the US. The group claims it is a foreign principal, while also addressing potential inaccuracies and incomplete information in the registration.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "RSS Friends registered with the US Department of Justice as a foreign agent under the Foreign Agents Registration Act (FARA) on August 27.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "RSS Friends listed Rashtriya Swayamsevak Sangh, Keshavkunj, New Delhi as its 'foreign principal' in the registration document.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The group claimed to be in compliance with the FARA, stating it does not have a written contract or agreement with RSS.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
